#
# Counter-example for math:UnanchoredGluingObstruction: a math:GluingObstruction that
# names no math:obstructionOf sheaf — an H¹ obstruction class floating free of the
# math:CellularSheaf whose local-to-global lifting it is supposed to obstruct. The
# math:GluingObstruction frame's qualified min-count on math:obstructionOf fails, so
# validation MUST emit shacl.QualifiedMinCountConstraintComponent (and no other
# finding).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/gluing/> .

# An obstruction class that names no sheaf it obstructs — unanchored.
ex:orphanObstruction a math:GluingObstruction .
